Z||000002||Monkeyman||11-11-2001||01:30 PM||||Good news and bad news.  The bad news is that you can't buy the dash.  That's Eddy Snaaws creation and is the most beautiful interior I've ever seen.  He sold the molds to some loser here in the states.  Said loser modified the heck out of it and is now trying to sell his version for around $2500.  The tail lights can be purchased through PISA as can the front end (ZR2).  V8Archie chopped the top on the blue fastback (costs big bucks but looks great, eh?).  The decklid is Skitimes own creation.  Hopefully, he'll start selling a kit for it in the future.<P>Hope you have a rich uncle as you'll be well into 5 figures by the time you get done.  Show us some pics of either your work in progress or the final product.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
